        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: \"(2) The Disciplinary Committee shall not make any order under subsection (1A), based upon any of the circumstances set out in paragraphs (l)(b) to (d), or paragraphs (l)(f) to (o), unless an opportunity of being heard either personally or by a person appointed by the registered Engineer has been given to the registered Engineer against whom the Disciplinary Committee intends to make the order.\";"
