        "@value": "Section 24 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words \"ten thousand ringgit in the case of an individual, or fifty thousand ringgit in the case of a sole proprietorship, partnership or body corporate,\" the words \"fifty thousand ringgit\". Amendment of section 24B"
      }
    },
