      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subparagraph 2(5) of the First Schedule is amended by substituting for the word \"15\" the words \"7A, 7B\". Saving and transitional"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/eng@/~cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All proceedings under sections 7A and 15 and matters relating to such proceedings pending before the Board, and all proceedings under sections 24 and 25 pending, immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, after the date of coming into operation of this Act, be continued as if the principal Act had not been amended by this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Registration of Engineers (Amendment) Act 2006."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Registration of Engineers Act 1967 [Act 138], which is referred to as the \"principal Act\" in this Act, is amended in section 2 by inserting after the definition of \"Graduate Engineer\" the following definition: ' \"Minister\" means the Minister for the time being charged with the responsibility for matters relating to works;'. Amendment of section 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 3(3)(c) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the word \"employee's\" the words \"employees,\". Amendment of section 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/eng@/~cl_4",
